    "command": "LEAN_BRIDGE_NATIVE_TEST_GLIBC_FLOOR=2.36 LEAN_BRIDGE_RUBY_RECURSIVE_CALLABLE_TEST=1 node --test tests/ruby-recursive-callables.test.mjs",
    "scope": "Original RubyGems-only packages preserve recursive callbacks and captured closures on ordinary-source and reviewed-IR paths. Each original gem installs offline after producer removal, then relocates and runs after handoff and gem-cache removal with no compiler tools. Each installation passes 379 recursive checks, 51335 acyclic checks, 9958 injected failures, nine direct callback-owner checks and malformed-output retirement probes, including in-memory counterfactual guard removal. Lifetime checks cover creator exit, recycled native thread IDs, closure capacity, deferred close and finalization with zero retained identities. Exact publisher and consumer examples compile and run. All installed files and the original receipt remain unchanged.",
